$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Air";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Othlia Jenks" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> are battling for the Green Mile. Both teams want the green mile station because it has many strengths. Cature the other teams flag 3 times and hold the objective and you will have the green mile! If you don't the green mile will destroy you and your team.";
